<title>USA: N.Y. certificated cotton stocks fall to 168,818.</title>
<headline>N.Y. certificated cotton stocks fall to 168,818.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Certificated cotton stocks deliverable against New York Cotton Exchange's No. 2 cotton futures contract as of June 26 totaled 168,818 bales, down from 169,352 bales the previous session.</p>
<p>There were no bales issued, no bales awaiting review, 534 cancellations, and 8,041 decertification orders.</p>
<p>-- New York Commodity Desk, 212-859-1640</p>
